flowchart LR
  SRC[Trusted local fixture source] --> FILE[Temporary directory and fixture.py]
  FILE --> PROC[Python isolated mode subprocess]
  PROC --> OUT[stdout pipe drain]
  PROC --> ERR[stderr pipe drain]
  OUT --> CAP[Retain up to configured bytes; mark truncation]
  ERR --> CAP
  TIMER[Wall-clock timeout] --> PROC
  CAP --> RESULT[Exit code, bounded output, truncation flags]
  RESULT --> CLEAN[Temporary directory cleanup]
  HOST[Container / VM / OS policy] -. required for untrusted code; not supplied .-> PROC
